message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Computational Gender Analysis of Pride and Prejudice"
abstract: >
  A corpus-linguistic study of how syntactic structures encode character agency
  and gendered representation across Jane Austen's Pride and Prejudice. The project
  uses dependency parsing with spaCy's transformer pipeline to quantify agency
  ratios, verb frames, and adjectival characterization by gender.
